   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2026-10-06T14:38:30-05:00",
   "body": "Relatively low drop rate. Expect to grind them for a while. Took me 8 kills, but a guild mate got his in 19.\r\n\r\nDon't pull too many at a time unless you can interrupt. The [b]disciples[/b] heal a lot, and fights might start dragging on otherwise.\r\n\r\nEven when you get it, you may want to continue grinding the mobs until they drop [item=5352]. This starts a new quest that you simply turn in for [b]1950 XP[/b] and some reputation. The drop rate for this book appears to be even lower, though. I didn't track my kills for this, but I spent around 35 minutes just grinding non-stop whereas the eye only dropped after a few.",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
}